 after return, all dependent forms `pending`, queue holds their work.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/02-derivation-pipeline/stories/05-message-edit-cascade.md:91:| TC-5.3 | `test/mutations.test.ts` | post-return: dependents `pending`, replacements queued at new source version; replacement ids include source version; superseded queued ids on the MutationResult, rows deleted |\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/02-derivation-pipeline/stories/05-message-edit-cascade.md:155:- [ ] Synchronous mutation proven: content, estimate, and full cascade commit in the edit's transaction before return (TC-5.1, TC-5.3)\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/04-turn-state-machine/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:141:- The corrupt fixture is the one sanctioned below-SDK write — direct insert of a second open-turn row, possible only because the contract makes the state unreachable through any operation.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/04-turn-state-machine/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:283:| TC-5.3 | cross-thread keys | same key, two threads | both record |\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/coverage.md:45:| AC-5.3 | Story 2 | TC-5.3 | — |\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:4:You are the story lead for `02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment` on durable story run `02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment-story-run-001`.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:19:Path: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/stories/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment.md\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:27:Add the `createSdk` inference construction path: one host model-call function plus complete per-kind model assignments.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:34:**Objective:** Establish the production inference seam and validate model assignments loudly at SDK construction.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:36:**Scope In:** `provider` XOR `inference`, `ModelCall` contract, complete assignment validation, adapter construction wiring, and per-call provider/model routing.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:45:- **AC-1.1**: `createSdk` accepts exactly one of `provider` (a `DerivationProvider`, unchanged) or `inference` (model-call function + assignments). Both supplied, or neither, is a caller error naming the rule.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:48:- **AC-1.4**: Per-call routing: each drained work item looks up its kind's assignment and the function receives that assignment's provider and model strings. Different kinds routing to different providers in one config work item-by-item with no cross-kind interference.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:55:  - unknown kind key in assignments returns `TypeError` naming it\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:58:  - empty `provider` or `model` string in one assignment returns `TypeError`\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:72:This story establishes the SDK construction boundary for real inference. `createSdk` accepts exactly one provider arrival path: direct `provider` injection or `inference` config. On the inference path, SDK validation resolves the assignment map and builds the real adapter into the same `DerivationProvider` slot the deterministic provider already uses.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:74:The external boundary is the host-supplied `ModelCall`. LHC owns provider/model assignment and prompt selection; the host owns credentialed transport.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:154:  assignments: Record<FormKind, ModelAssignment>;\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:170:  assignments: {\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:190:| empty provider/model | assignment field and kind |\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:195:- Do not accept partial assignment maps.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:201:- Entrypoint: `createSdk({ inference: { call, assignments } })`.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:219:- Inference assignments validate all seven `FormKind`s, reject unknown keys, reject unknown prompts, and reject empty provider/model strings.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:246:| `test/view-boundary.test.ts` (amended) + `test/view-boundary-turn-end.test.ts` (new) | default | TC-5.1, TC-5.2, TC-5.3 |\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:255:- `recordingCall(responses: Record<FormKind, string>)` → `{ call: ModelCall, log: ModelCallInput[] }`. Resolves each call with the kind's canned text (kind inferred from the assignment the test built — in practice keyed by `model` string, which tests assign uniquely per kind). Every input pushed to `log`.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:259:- `validAssignments(overrides?)` → a complete seven-kind assignment map for construction tests, each kind assigned a distinct fake provider/model string.\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:265:**`test/fixtures/seam-conformance.ts`** (Chunk 0) — the parameterized contract assertions (DD-13): `assertModelCallContract(call)` (shape of success/failure results on a probe call) and `assertRoutingThroughSdk(call, assignments)` (TC-1.2's routing assertions extracted so TC-4.3 runs them against the real host unchanged).\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:275:- unknown kind key in assignments → `TypeError` naming it\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:278:- empty `provider`/`model` string in one assignment → `TypeError`\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:293:- each form's `metadata.provenance` equals its assignment `{ provider, model, prompt }`; deterministic-provider forms carry none\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:348:### TC-5.3 — Epic 03 contract regression under the new trigger (AC-5.5)\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:404:| Boundary decision and status sum diverge | shared-query invariant + TC-5.3's status leg after each advance |\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:418:- latest_response_path: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/006-verify.json\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:428:path: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/006-verify.json\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:444:      storyId: \"02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:447:      id: \"02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:450:      - \"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/stories/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment.md\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:453:      - \"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/005-implementor.json\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:468:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Verified Story 2 AC-1.1 through AC-1.4 and TC-1.1/TC-1.2 against the story, tech design, test plan, implementation, fixtures, and gates. createSdk now enforces provider/inference XOR, validates complete assignments, builds the inference adapter into the provider slot, and routing tests inspect actual ModelCall inputs across all seven kinds and mixed lanes.\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:479:        - \"AC-1.3: assignment validation iterates FORM_KINDS, rejects unknown keys, missing kinds, unknown prompt names, and empty provider/model before adapter construction. Evidence packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts:321-358 and packages/lhc/test/inference-construction.test.ts:63-107.\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:480:        - \"AC-1.4: each adapter operation routes by its own FormKind assignment, and tests prove all seven kinds plus three-lane mixed provider routing. Evidence packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts:19-24 and :68-75, packages/lhc/test/inference-routing.test.ts:34-111.\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:510:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/006-verify.json\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:521:path: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/005-implementor.json\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:537:      storyId: \"02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:540:      id: \"02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:542:    planSummary: \"Built the Epic 05 inference seam plus its Chunk-0 foundation: new src/inference/ layer (boundary types, failure-classification table, name-keyed prompt registry with seven pre-dial-in templates, createInferenceProvider adapter implementing DerivationProvider with per-kind assignment routing and config-copied provenance); createSdk now validates provider XOR inference first, then the complete assignment map by iterating the exported FORM_KINDS runtime set (missing kind, unknown kind key, unknown prompt, empty provider/model — each a TypeError naming the violation, no partial construction) and slots the adapter into the same resolved.provider slot direct injection uses; FormKind became a const-derived union and ProviderResult/DerivedFormMetadata gained the provenance fields; the boundaries check gained the inference-may-not-import-domains rule; scripted-host fixtures (recordingCall/scriptedCall/throwingCall/hangingCall/validAssignments) and parameterized seam-conformance helpers (assertModelCallContract, assertRoutingThroughSdk) back TC-1.1/TC-1.2, with the routing helpers asserting the actual serialized ModelCall inputs emitted during a real intake→drain across all seven kinds.\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:552:        reason: \"createInferenceProvider: per-kind assignment lookup, prompt render, host call with thrown-exception containment, result mapping with config-copied provenance (DD-2, AC-1.4)\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:582:        reason: \"XOR rule validated first; resolveInferenceProvider assignment validation over FORM_KINDS; adapter construction into resolved.provider; type-only exports of the inference vocabulary (value-export surface unchanged, retirement snapshot holds)\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:649:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/005-implementor.json\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:659:Path: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/001-current.json\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:663:storyRunId: \"02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment-story-run-001\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:664:storyId: \"02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment\"\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:674:    path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/art